# Example for .github/CODEOWNERS in a target repo. Replace the owners with your own teams.
# Later rules take precedence over earlier ones.

# Default: any reviewer with write access
*                       @OWNER/engineering

# Security-owned paths: the security team must approve these (enforce with "Require review from Code Owners")
/.github/               @OWNER/security
/.github/workflows/     @OWNER/security
.gitattributes          @OWNER/security
.gitmodules             @OWNER/security
**/CODEOWNERS           @OWNER/security
**/*iam*                @OWNER/security
**/*kms*                @OWNER/security
**/*security_group*     @OWNER/security
**/auth/**              @OWNER/security
**/crypto/**            @OWNER/security
**/secrets/**           @OWNER/security
**/*.tf                 @OWNER/security
